[CA]
“A RESOLUTION AUTHORIZING THE MAYOR AND THE CITY CLERK TO SIGN A
FINAL PLAT FOR THE POINT, 4TH FILING, A REPLAT OF LOTS 11,12 & 13, BLOCK 14, THE
POINTE, SECOND FILING, CHEYENNE, WYOMING (LOCATED SOUTH OF THE
